\f1\fs22 The cops didn\'92t take Sarah and Tony to a hospital. They took them to one each.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>They chauffeured Sarah to a palace in the sky where she would have access to the best care, including positive affirmation of her Airborne birthright. Tony they rolled out of the cruiser onto a crumbling tenement clinic rooftop below the Layer and left him there. Alexander agreed it would have to do.\
